                                "sense_id": "04c64abb-ac50-350a-b805-59f12a3900c4",
                                "text": "The WCBS (N. Y.) broadcastress, with three other vimful and vigorous grannies, are here encased in a series of Anglo-French-Italo travelogs done with diverting prose and an eye on the anecdotal snapper."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66436789-2783-442b-89bf-81decbb588e6",
                                "sense_id": "04c64abb-ac50-350a-b805-59f12a3900c4",
                                "text": "You are, however, constantly aware that you’re driving a Sports Car. Like Prospero’s isle, the C-5 is full of noises. Some have been left in on purpose; it’s supposed to sound vimful and virile."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d619e6d-1fa6-4e65-8851-dcf97ce11d59",
                                "sense_id": "04c64abb-ac50-350a-b805-59f12a3900c4",
                                "text": "Their album, Bengali Bantam Youth Experience, even has musical merit in its vimful conjoining of beats, guitar and Bollywood strings."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
